OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 1 Nov to Tue 10 Nov
OL,6,FPressure is set to build in the
OL,7,Fvicinity of the UK as we move into
OL,8,Fearly November, with a lot of dry
OL,9,Fweather as a result. Cloud amounts
OL,10,Fwill be quite variable with weak
OL,11,Ffronts bringing a focus of cloud, and
OL,12,Fpossibly light rain at times, but
OL,13,Fthere is no significant bias to where
OL,14,Fthese are favoured. Within the high
OL,15,Fpressure, some places, perhaps more
OL,16,Flikely towards the east, will likely
OL,17,Fsee overnight and morning fog, which
OL,18,Fat this time of year could take a
OL,19,Fwhile to clear and where it lingers,
OL,20,Fit will remain chilly. Otherwise,
OL,21,Ftemperatures generally fairly close to
OL,22,Faverage for most during this period.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,FWinds will generally be light,
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Falthough stronger for the coastal
OL,25,Fnorth at times.
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
